Z||000000||grinthock||09-10-2001||02:19 PM||||Well everyone the wedding of Geroge "The Bandit" Balzer and Becky "The Witch" Balzer is official.<P>They had a beautiful ceremony at Baccus Mills in St. Williams (Port Rowan) Ontario over the weekend.  Pictures will be posted as soon as they are in.<P>From the Fiero crowd we managed<BR>Bandit Balz (in his Wedding decorated 86GT)<BR>Grinthock (ME! In my my decorated 87 GT)<BR>FieroHeather (My Navigator)<BR>SlammedFiero (Brought his AMAZING Fastback!)<P><BR>It was an amazing ceremony and party.  The cruise back was amazing!  We had a great drive, a little bit of fun on the highways.<P>SlammedFiero was nice enough to give Bandit and myself a DEMO of his new BIG BRAKE conversion.   All I can say is those P-Zero's plus the big brakes are AMAZING!!! I have NEVER seen a fiero brake like that... Truly awesome!  I gotta say I like the mods on your car Slammed!<P><BR>It was a great time had by all, we had a nice beach house motel rooms cheap too, we have pics of the cars on the beach by the professional photographer at the wedding.  As well as pictures of us in front of our vehicles!<P>I had the privlidge of being "MC" for the evening making sure the party went as planned, smooth as silk.<P>Well that's it, truly amazing weekend, too bad more Fiero guys couldn't make it, I know it was a busy weekend for everyone.  BanditBalz wo'nt see this thread for a WEEK everyone so let's keep it bumped until he returns from his honeymoon.<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
